# IoT-Smart-Safety-Monitoring-System
ESP32-based safety monitoring system simulated using Wokwi
## Project Overview

This project simulates an IoT-based safety monitoring system using an ESP32 in Wokwi.

## Components Used
- ESP32
- Two potentiometers (simulated sensor inputs)
- Red LED
- Green LED
- Buzzer
- 220Ω resistors

## Working
- Monitors simulated temperature and gas levels.
- Green LED indicates a safe condition.
- Red LED and buzzer indicate an unsafe condition.
- Sensor values and status are displayed in the Serial Monitor.

## Tools Used
- Arduino C++
- Wokwi Simulator
- GitHub

## Project Type
Virtual simulation project. No physical hardware used.

## Future Improvements
- Connect real sensors.
- Add Wi-Fi notifications.
- Develop a monitoring dashboard.
